	(text "POWER (USB VBUS 5 V, 500 mA max). Estimated draw ~370 mA after enumeration (see README budget).\nU401 buck 5V->3.3V (0.8 V x (1+316k/100k) = 3.33 V): FPGA I/O, SDRAM, FT2232H.\nU402 LDO 3.3->1.2 V: FPGA core.  U403 LP5907 LDO 5->3.0 V: ADC + clock (low noise).\nU404 LM27762: +/-3.97 V (1.2 V x (1+115k/49.9k)) for the analog front ends.\nAN_EN: Q401 inverts FT2232H PWREN# so U403/U404 start only after USB configuration\n(keeps pre-enumeration draw < 100 mA). VBUS capacitance ~8 uF (< 10 uF USB limit).\nTODO verify against LM27762 datasheet: FB- divider topology and CP / flying-cap values."
		(at 121.92 172.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "07ae371c-9bdb-42a1-ad92-63ffa720870e")
	)
